sequenceDiagram
    actor I as Inspector
    participant C as call_copilot
    participant DB as Oracle AI Database
    participant S as SDK LLM (card + extractor)
    participant L as Agent LLM

    I->>C: narrative (asset + inspector)
    C->>DB: 1. resolve thread (SDK)
    C->>DB: 2. get_asset() · CITY_ASSET
    C->>DB: 3a. get_context_card reads · CITY_MESSAGE (recent) + CITY_MEMORY (relevant search)
    C->>S: 3b. get_context_card summarizes recent messages → summary + topics (every turn)
    S-->>C: card summary + topics
    C->>DB: 4. find_similar_findings() · VECTOR_DISTANCE on CITY_INSPECTION_FINDING
    C->>L: 5. system prompt + assembled context
    L-->>C: 6. diagnosis
    C->>DB: 7. add_messages() · write CITY_MESSAGE
    C->>S: 8a. extractor distills typed records + refreshes stored summary
    S-->>DB: 8b. write CITY_MEMORY (records) + CITY_THREAD (stored summary)
    C-->>I: answer
